# Cloudera Agent Studio — Workflow environment (paste real values at workflow setup)
# Agent Studio does NOT persist MCP env secrets after registration; set them per workflow.
#
# IMPORTANT: graph file lives inside the semantica clone — NOT /home/cdsw/data/
